  "notes": "Strong early-game client: Western-trained, close to the US and UK, fighting smugglers on the Syrian border and ISIS remnants, and intercepting Iranian missiles and drones in 2026 (Iran's IRGC claimed strikes on Azraq air base). Peace treaty with Israel (1994) but relations are cold because of the Gaza war; Jordan is the custodian of Jerusalem's Muslim holy sites and trains Palestinian Authority security forces. Arms flow to PA forces (e.g. Al-Jawad armoured vehicles) has passed through Jordan with Israeli approval.",
